/-!
# The direct call of `%2` through a ring under `mono` `&` (track K, README Gaps 19 (h))

Generated by `tools/gen/ringlinkm.py` (copies of `CompRunDirectMonoB.lean` and
`CompRunTCall.lean` with the `rin` of the subject generalised to `RIN`, every replacement
asserted, plus the parts on a ring); do not edit by hand.

The links of `CompRunDirectMonoB.lean` and `CompRunTCall.lean` push `rin` as `A 0`.  Here `rin`
is any unit `unitNoun id rin` whose ring is a ring noun (`RinOk`): the gates `call-op` and
`jump-op` (lines 3985 to 4006) then emit `%caf` / `%csf` / `%jmf` / `%jsf`, the model's
`callOpR` / `jumpOpR` (`Ska/CompRingCall.lean`).

* `RinOk`, `crdBlockMMR` (step `7` with `rin`, `crdBlockMMR_none`), `monoBlocksR_eq`.
* `crd_blkMR_done`, `crd_blkMR_next`: the pill's step `7` with `rin` is `crdBlockMMR`.
* `crd_7to9MR`, `crdCallMMR`, `crd_from7MTR`: steps `7` to `14`, `rin` never read again.
* **`crd_callMTG`**: the call (`crDCall`) through a ring, the rest threaded, against any `R`.
* `crd_model_callMR`, `runLCMR_n2_directM`, `crd_model_n2MR`: the model `callDMR`.
* **`comp_run_n2_callMonoTTG`**: the case `%2` on a direct call not dropped, against
  `runLCMR env true msup`, with `env.ring b = rin`.
* `km_crdBlockMMR`, `km_monoBlocksR`, `crdBlockMMR_sub`, `monoBlocksR_sub`, `crd_goalsMR`: the
  blocks with a ring keep the counters, `sub-pes` fresh, the goals of `q` and `p`.
* `PartRTR` (a threaded part against `runLCMR`), `crd_hpqMTR`, `crd_model_dropMR`,
  `comp_run_n2_dropMonoTR` (the dropped call, which never reads `rin`), **`comp_run_n2_directXTTG`**
  (the case `%2` dropped or not, parts threaded, against `runLCMR env true msup`).
-/

namespace Formalization
